    <section class="card">
      <h2>For Teams</h2>
      <p>A shared AI workspace that keeps your team coordinated, tracks shared data and processes, and keeps everyone talking.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>For Families</h2>
      <p>An always-on assistant that keeps schedules, plans, and reminders in one place.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>For Executives</h2>
      <p>A personal assistant that handles the details, so you can stay focused on the big picture.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <p class="cta"><a class="button" href="mailto:keith@outside-ai.com?subject=Hello%20Outside%20AI">Email keith@outside-ai.com</a></p>
